[com_23]
type=text
x=6
y=69
width=583
height=30
layer=com_7
textfont=graphic_17813
fontmono=no
text=Count check has recently appeared in Burthorpe and is hosting Community Support Week 2016!, He's got a bunch of rewards and information for you so go and check him out!
textshadow=yes

[com_24]
type=text
x=6
y=107
width=320
height=23
layer=com_7
textfont=cinzel_18pt_bold
fontmono=no
text=Count Checks Account Check!
textalignv=centre
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffcb05

[com_25]
type=text
x=6
y=134
width=583
height=30
layer=com_7
textfont=graphic_17813
fontmono=no
text=Count check is great at checking accounts, he'll tell you all about your account security and if you've got a secure enough account he'll even reward you for it! Check him out!
textshadow=yes

[com_26]
type=text
x=6
y=172
width=252
height=23
layer=com_7
textfont=cinzel_18pt_bold
fontmono=no
text=The Drop!
textalignv=centre
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffcb05

[com_27]
type=text
x=7
y=199
width=583
height=53
layer=com_7
textfont=graphic_17813
fontmono=no
text=With the appearance of Count Check he's also brought back the drop! Compete against other players for a title and xp lamp rewards.<br> Also if you complete the drop with every question correct you'll be entered into a real life raffle!<br> The next drop will be activated in 00mins
textshadow=yes

[com_28]
type=text
x=7
y=260
width=490
height=23
layer=com_7
textfont=cinzel_18pt_bold
fontmono=no
text=Introducing Community Support Clue Scrolls!
textalignv=centre
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffcb05

[com_29]
type=text
x=7
y=287
width=583
height=82
layer=com_7
textfont=graphic_17813
fontmono=no
text=Count Check also has another trick up his sleeve!, Clue scrolls! Every day during CS week you'll be able to ask him for a Special Community Support Clue Scroll which will reward two caskets per clue! However one of these caskets can only be opened if you have an authenticator AND a bank pin!<br>Also If you miss a day, it doesn't matter you can catch up on missed days anytime you like during CS week!
textshadow=yes

[com_30]
type=text
x=10
y=2
width=252
height=23
layer=com_19
textfont=cinzel_18pt_bold
fontmono=no
text=Drop Rewards!
textalignv=centre
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffcb05

[com_31]
type=text
x=10
y=27
width=16
height=146
widthmode=minus
layer=com_19
textfont=graphic_17813
fontmono=no
text=This version of the drop is has Community Support Themed questions, so get those security hats on!<br>The rewards you'll be able to get from the drop are:<br><br> - The knowledgeable Title!<br> - A Large Exp Lamp<br> - Entry into an exclusive CS Week only Raffle
textshadow=yes

[com_32]
type=layer
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
layer=com_9
onload=rs3_background_panel(event_com, struct_21361)

[com_33]
type=text
x=10
y=2
width=252
height=23
layer=com_9
textfont=cinzel_18pt_bold
fontmono=no
text=Security Rewards!
textalignv=centre
textshadow=yes
colour=0xffcb05

[com_34]
type=text
x=10
y=27
width=16
height=27
widthmode=minus
heightmode=minus
layer=com_9
textfont=graphic_17813
fontmono=no
text=Through out CS week if you have a Bank PIN and Authenticator you'll get lots of bonus rewards!<br> - If you have a Bank PIN or Authenticator enabled you'll recieve one additional Treasure hunter key and if you've got both enabled you'll recieve two! You'll also be entered into a competition to win membersship, concept art & other prizes! <br> - If you boast your secure account to Count Check and he's impressed he'll give you an extra xp lamp<br> - When completing the Customer Service scrolls if you have a Secure account you'll be able to open an extra casket every day!
textshadow=yes

